        "text": "Regulated entities are advised to take note of the aforementioned UNSC communications and ensure meticulous compliance. Yours faithfully, Sd/- (Veena Srivastava) Chief General Manager -------------------------------- * APT Remarks : i. Chapter IX of Reserve Bank of India (Commercial Banks - Know Your Customer) Directions, 2025 (Updated as on 29-12-2025). ii. Chapter IX of Reserve Bank of India (Small Finance Banks - Know Your Customer) Directions, 2025 (Updated as on 29-12-2025) iii. Chapter IX of Reserve Bank of India (Payments Banks - Know Your Customer) Directions, 2025 (Updated as on 29-12-2025) iv. Chapter IX of Reserve Bank of India (Urban Co-operative Banks - Know Your Customer) Directions, 2025 (Updated as on 29-12-2025) v. Chapter IX of Reserve Bank of India (Rural Co-operative Banks - Know Your Customer) Directions, 2025 (Updated as on 29-12-2025) vi. Chapter IX of Reserve Bank of India (Regional Rural Banks - Know Your Customer) Directions, 2025 (Updated as on 29-12-2025) vii. Chapter IX of Reserve Bank of India (Local Area Banks - Know Your Customer) Directions, 2025 (Updated as on 29-12-2025) viii. Chapter IX of Reserve Bank of India (Non-Banking Financial Companies - Know Your Customer) Directions, 2025 (Updated as on 29-12-2025) ix. Chapter IX of Reserve Bank of India (Asset Reconstruction Companies - Know Your Customer) Directions, 2025 (Updated as on 29-12-2025) x. Chapter IX of Reserve Bank of India (All India Financial Institutions - Know Your Customer) Directions, 2025 (Updated as on 29-12-2025) KMT from the Alpha Plus Suite of Solutions! © Alpha Plus Technologies Pvt. Ltd.",
