        "text": "In exercise of the powers conferred by Sections 45JA, 45L and 45M of the Reserve Bank of India Act, 1934, the Reserve Bank, being satisfied that it is necessary and expedient in public interest so to do, hereby issues the Amendment Directions hereinafter specified.",
