        "changeType": "amended",
        "text": "Short Title and Commencement (1) These Directions shall be called the Reserve Bank of India (Small Finance Banks - Responsible Business Conduct) Fourth Amendment Directions, 2026. (2) These Directions shall come into effect from January 1, 2027.",
        "obligationIds": [],
