        "section": null,
        "changeType": "amended",
        "text": "Short Title and Commencement (1) These Directions shall be called the Reserve Bank of India (Urban Co-operative Banks - Responsible Business Conduct) Fourth Amendment Directions, 2026. (2) These Directions shall come into effect from January 1, 2027.",
        "obligationIds": [],
        "previousText": "These directions shall be applicable to all Urban Co-operative Banks (hereinafter collectively referred to as 'UCBs' and individually as a 'UCB'). In this context, Urban Co-operative Banks shall mean Primary Co-operative Banks as defined under section 5(ccv) read with Section 56 of Banking Regulation Act, 1949."
